#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:7
msgid ""
"VMware NSX offers network virtualization allowing for creation and "
"management of software-based virtual networks in an efficient and "
"programmatic way. |morpheus| offers a full-featured integration with NSX, "
"including Project scoping for NSX 4+ integrations. |morpheus| will ingest "
"and expose its networking abstractions in the following sections of the "
"|morpheus| NSX integration:"
msgstr ""
"VMware NSX offers network virtualization allowing para creation y management"
" of software-based virtual networks in un efficient y programmatic way. "
"|morpheus| offers un full-featured integration con NSX, including Project "
"scoping para NSX 4+ integrations. |morpheus| será ingest y expose its "
"networking abstractions in las siguientes secciones of el |morpheus| NSX "
"integration:"

