#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:39
msgid "NSX Projects"
msgstr "NSX Projects"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:41
msgid ""
"Projects in NSX are analogous to tenants in other products and are a part of"
" NSX version 4+. Projects allow for the isolation of networking abstractions"
" into individual tenants within a single NSX appliance. If your organization"
" is already utilizing NSX Projects, you are probably very familiar with "
"their concept and execution but others can find high-level details about "
"them `here <https://docs.vmware.com/en/VMware-"
"NSX/4.1/administration/GUID-52180BC5-A1AB-4BC2-B1CE-666292505317.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"Projects in NSX son analogous to tenants in otro products y son un part of "
"NSX versión 4+. Projects allow para el isolation of networking abstractions "
"en individual tenants dentro de un único NSX appliance. If your organization"
" es ya utilizing NSX Projects, you son probably muy familiar con their "
"concept y execution pero others puede find high-level detalles about them "
"`here <https://docs.vmware.com/en/VMware-"
"NSX/4.1/administration/GUID-52180BC5-A1AB-4BC2-B1CE-666292505317.html>`_."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:43
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports a full-featured integration with NSX, including the "
"ability to scope the |morpheus| integration to a specific Project the "
"service user can access. Using Project-scoped integrations allows multiple "
"NSX integrations to be made to the same NSX appliance and ensures |morpheus|"
" users are siloed to only the NSX Projects they can access."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| supports un full-featured integration con NSX, including el "
"ability to scope el |morpheus| integration to un específico Project el "
"servicio user puede acceso. Using Project-scoped integrations allows "
"múltiples NSX integrations to be made to el mismo NSX appliance y ensures "
"|morpheus| users son siloed to solo el NSX Projects they puede acceso."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:46
msgid "Add NSX Integration to |morpheus|"
msgstr "Add NSX Integration to |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:48
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:49
msgid "Select Select :guilabel:`+ ADD` > VMWare NSX"
msgstr "Select Select :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR` > VMWare NSX"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:50
msgid "Enter the following:"
msgstr "Ingrese el following:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:52
msgid "**NAME:** Name for the NSX Integration in |morpheus|"
msgstr "**NAME:** Name para el NSX Integration in |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:53
msgid ""
"**VISIBILITY:** Public (available to all |morpheus| Tenants) or Private "
"(available only to the current Tenant). This option is shown only in the "
"|morpheus| |mastertenant|"
msgstr ""
"**VISIBILITY:** Public (disponible to todos |morpheus| Tenants) o Private "
"(disponible solo to el actual Tenant). This opción es shown solo in el "
"|morpheus| |mastertenant|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:54
msgid "**API HOST:** URL of the NSX Manager (ex. https://x.x.x.x/api)"
msgstr "**API HOST:** URL of el NSX Manager (ex. https://x.x.x.x/api)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:55
msgid ""
"**CREDENTIALS:** A pre-stored credential set can be used to create this "
"integration. If \"Local Credentials\" is selected, USERNAME and PASSWORD "
"fields are presented and must be filled"
msgstr ""
"**CREDENTIALS:** A pre-stored credential set se puede utilizar para create "
"esta integración. If \"Local Credentials\" es seleccionado, USERNAME y "
"PASSWORD campos son presented y debe be filled"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:56
msgid ""
"**USERNAME:** NSX service account username. Prior to NSX version 4, this is "
"likely an admin account with access to all networking constructs. In NSX "
"version 4 and higher, this could be an admin for access to default space "
"constructs or it could be a Project-specific user depending on the access "
"needs of the integration being created"
msgstr ""
"**USERNAME:** NSX servicio cuenta nombre de usuario. Prior to NSX versión 4,"
" este es likely un admin cuenta con acceso to todos networking constructs. "
"In NSX versión 4 y higher, este podría be un admin para acceso to "
"predeterminado space constructs o it podría be un Project-específico user "
"dependiendo de el acceso needs of la integración being creado"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:57
msgid "**PASSWORD:** The password for the NSX service account entered above"
msgstr ""
"**PASSWORD:** The contraseña para el NSX servicio cuenta entered anterior"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:58
msgid ""
"**PROJECT:** As soon as an API HOST and credentials are provided, |morpheus|"
" will attempt to authenticate with the NSX appliance. When authentication is"
" successful and a NSX 4+ appliance is detected, a PROJECT field will appear "
"and the dropdown will be pre-populated with Projects accessible to the "
"service user account"
msgstr ""
"**PROJECT:** As soon as un API HOST y credentials son provided, |morpheus| "
"será attempt to authenticate con el NSX appliance. When authentication es "
"exitoso y un NSX 4+ appliance es detected, un PROJECT campo será appear y el"
" desplegable será be pre-populated con Projects accessible to el servicio "
"user cuenta"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:59
msgid ""
"**VMWARE CLOUD:** Select the existing VMware cloud associated with this NSX "
"integration"
msgstr ""
"**VMWARE CLOUD:** Seleccione el existente VMware cloud asociado con este NSX"
" integration"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:61
msgid "Select :guilabel:`ADD NETWORK INTEGRATION`"
msgstr "Select :guilabel:`AGREGAR RED INTEGRATION`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:63
msgid ""
"Once the NSX Integration is added |morpheus| will sync in existing Transport"
" Zones, DHCP servers and relays, Segments, firewall groups and rules, "
"Gateways, Edge Clusters, and Groups. We can manage these synced items from "
"within |morpheus| UI, including the ability to create, edit, and delete "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Once el NSX Integration es agregado |morpheus| será sync in existente "
"Transport Zones, DHCP servers y relays, Segments, firewall groups y rules, "
"Gateways, Edge Clusters, y Groups. We puede manage estos synced elementos "
"desde dentro de |morpheus| UI, including el ability to create, edit, y "
"delete them."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/nsxt.rst:65
msgid ""
"The available tabs on the integration detail page will be dependent on the "
"Project selected when the integration was created. Just like in NSX, the "
"default view (and thus integrations scoped to the default Project) will have"
" access to all constructs whereas individual Projects will not. Integrations"
" scoped to individual Projects can view the DHCP, Segments, Firewall, Tier-1"
" Gateways, and Groups tabs but not the other tabs described here. These "
"limitations are identical to those in the NSX console UI. More information "
"on NSX Projects is available `here <https://docs.vmware.com/en/VMware-"
"NSX/4.1/administration/GUID-52180BC5-A1AB-4BC2-B1CE-666292505317.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"The disponible tabs on la integración página de detalles será be dependent "
"on el Project seleccionado cuando la integración fue creado. Just like in "
"NSX, el predeterminado view (y thus integrations scoped to el predeterminado"
" Project) será tienen acceso to todos constructs whereas individual Projects"
" no. Integrations scoped to individual Projects puede view el DHCP, "
"Segments, Firewall, Tier-1 Gateways, y Groups tabs pero no el otro tabs "
"described aquí. These limitations son identical to esos in el NSX console "
"UI. More información on NSX Projects es disponible `here "
"<https://docs.vmware.com/en/VMware-"
"NSX/4.1/administration/GUID-52180BC5-A1AB-4BC2-B1CE-666292505317.html>`_."

